      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Massieville%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Massieville lies in the Appalachian foothills of Ohio, just south of Chillicothe.",
